# Secrets used by feature hooks. Never commit real values.
#
# Provide each one in ONE of these ways (checked in this order, see scripts/lib/secrets.sh):
#   1. environment:   GH_TOKEN=... ./install.sh
#   2. pass:          pass insert omarchy-setup/GH_TOKEN
#   3. local file:    cp secrets.example ~/.config/omarchy-setup/secrets.env && chmod 600 it
#   4. GPG file:      gpg -e -r <your-key-id> -o ~/.config/omarchy-setup/secrets.env.gpg secrets.env
#
# Features declare what they need with `secret_require NAME` in feature_pre_install,
# so a missing secret stops the install before anything changes.
#
# No current feature needs a secret. Examples of what could go here:

# GitHub token for a feature that runs `gh auth login --with-token`
# GH_TOKEN=

# Wi-Fi password for a feature that pre-configures a known network
# HOME_WIFI_PSK=
